<metadata><name>Day 55 (stop 2 of 2) - Woodford Escarpment, Crevice Springs</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.593656" lon="-80.744459"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Woodford Parking: Along Woodford Crescent, as well as a large parking area at the…. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.600260" lon="-80.725070"><name>P2 alternative parking</name><desc>Limited parking along the Townline. Free. Joins the route near km 3.4 (750 m walk).</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.589562" lon="-80.745779"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Continue straight onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading north.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.592738" lon="-80.744896"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: You pass the start again. Keep going on the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading north.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.594147" lon="-80.742836"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Junction. Continue straight to stay on the main Bruce Trail, heading east. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.594738" lon="-80.741511"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Woodford Escarpment Side Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.597937" lon="-80.731064"><name>J5</name><desc>J5: Turn sharp right onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
